## Summary

**`logger_srcfile` crate** — complete rewrite:
- `SrcFileLogger::{src_warn, src_error}` now take `oxc_span::Span` by value (was `&swc_common::Span`)
- `WrapFileLogger<TLogger>` drops the `TSrcMap` type param; holds `NamedSource<String>` + `OnceCell<Vec<u32>>` for lazy line-start caching
- `WrapFileLogger::new(filename, source, logger)` constructor
- `SimpleSourceFileLogger` updated to new span type; emits `{path}:byte={start}:: {msg}`
- Removed `SrcLogger`/`HasSourceMap` (unused outside the crate)
- `swc-compat` feature adds `from_swc_source_file` adapter and `swc_span_to_oxc` helper
- Unit tests for LF, CRLF, mixed line endings, and span round-trip

**Call sites updated** with `swc_span_to_oxc(span)` wrappers and new constructors:
- `ast_name_tracker/src/visitor.rs` (production + test)
- `ast_segmenter/src/visitor.rs` (production + test)
- `unused_finder/src/parse/exports_visitor_runner.rs` + `exports_visitor_tests.rs`

All spot checks and workspace tests pass (only the pre-existing `repo-health` Dockerfile version mismatch fails, noted in `TODO.followups.md`).
